      },
      "message": "feat(machines): Makera Carvera and Carvera Air machine files\n\nFrom Makera's own spec tables (makera.com, read 2026-11-10): work area as\nthe full stroke either way, 200 W spindle to 15000 / 13000 rpm, one travel\nspeed for every axis (6000 / 4000 mm/min), the Carvera's six-tool changer,\nand the firmware's M7 air blast as the only coolant. Registered in\nposting::MACHINES; pinned by carvera_machines.\n\nRefs #707\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
