      },
      "message": "feat(post): a Makera Carvera post, in the firmware's own words\n\nOnly words the Carvera firmware's supported-codes tables list: G21 (an inch\nmachine is refused - G20 halts the firmware), M6 Tn with the firmware's own\ntool-length measuring (no G43), M3 S, the machine's M7 air, G2/G3 with\nrelative centres, M2 to end (M30 is no action there). No canned cycles, so\ndrilling posts as its expanded chain with G4 P dwells; tapping, control\ncutter compensation, tool 0 (the wireless probe), tilt and probing are\nrefused by name.\n\nPinned by carvera_post (two-tool pocket golden + refusals) and the\nconformance goldens under golden/nc/carvera/.\n\nFixes #707\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
